= News <novedades>

- #version: what is new in pgf-go after 0.2026.10.23: `goban-stone`, views of several parts, `shift`, `blank`, `grid.edge`, `layout.valign` and `layout.align-captions` (`layout.align` is renamed `layout.halign`), `origin` and `transpose` in `sgf-read`, boards of more than 25 columns and the diagrams of Sensei's Library. The examples of pgf-go, with a guide in PDF.
- 0.1.0: first version. It is a port of pgf-go 0.2026.10.23, with the same ideas and almost all of its options, written with Typst values (#pag(<desde-pgf-go>)). The complete list of changes is in the file `CHANGELOG.md`.
